et organizer apart is that you can stack 3 at a time according to space needs, which means it is a must-have space saver! it is very useful for organizing to hold spice jars, medicines bottles, beverages, canned goods, grab-and-go snacks, and even a variety of health/beauty aides, and small items","Anti-slip Durable and Convenient: We provide non-slip silicone stoppers at every base to prevent the bathroom countertop organizer from moving around, even when pulling out a drawer. The 8 support rods are made of rust-proof and durable aluminum alloy for long-lasting use. Assembly is easy - simply connect the bottom base and upper drawers with the 4 rods"],"pros":["Great value for money","Reliable build quality","Strong overall performance"],"cons":["May not suit every preference","Check our full review for trade-offs"],"root_gallery":"{https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DosoMTz6L.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510KxB6eg7L.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pYylb6g7L.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HVo7UCTzL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51akYhhdpfL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MH1VvgS7L.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ylaAPadhL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jl+loCAHL.SS125_PKplay-button-mb-image-grid-small_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01GK70BG4uL.svg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/sash//GN8m8-lU2_Dj38v.svg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/58da13ee-e0e3-4e0c-8fff-ac984e6e0707.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/f63564f2-f85b-489a-9c8c-7da174dc2223.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/0bd59111-8989-4712-8d94-1433cf45e1d3.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/c8e804da-106f-4078-9bdc-cc202f91b933.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/659806b1-c63b-4250-8412-2cfc340c45ba.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/ima